OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fsoon fading out to leave a dry night
OL,7,Fwith some clear spells, perhaps
OL,8,Fcloudier at times in the south and
OL,9,Faround the Isles. Winds falling light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FSome brightness across
OL,12,FArgyll. Otherwise rather cloudy with
OL,13,Fthe chance of a few showers in the
OL,14,Fsouth in the afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRain or
OL,17,Fshowers at times, occasionally heavy,
OL,18,Falong with some drier and brighter
OL,19,Fspells. Winds will be mostly light on
OL,20,FSunday but likely freshening on Monday
OL,21,Fand Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
